{
  "id": "MAT.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 27",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 66,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okoirwa ase Pilato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 15:1; Luk 23:1-2; Yoh 18:28-32)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bogachia gokia mambia, abakuani abanene bonsi na abatureti bagakora omoroberio bw’ogoita Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamosiba, bakamoira, bakamomoa Pilato, oyorenge gabana o Rumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kwa Yudasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yudasi, oria omoruete achia korora ng’a onacheirwe ekiina, ageitia, akairania chitaabu chiria chi’echifeta emerongo etato ase abakuani abanene na abagaaka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okobora, “Namochire ase okorua omonto otari na bobe bonde aitwe.” Barabwo bakaboora, “Ninki aya are ase tore? Echio n’echigurube chiao!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yudasi agatuguta chitaabu chiria chi’echifeta ase Hekalu ime, akaimoka, akagenda akeng’enta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abakuani abanene bakaimokia chitaabu chiria chi’echifeta bakaboora, “Tari boronge gochibeeka ase ekungo y’esadaka ya Nyasae, ekiagera chirochio nechie rigori ri’amanyinga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakanacha ekiina giokogora omogondo bw’omokori chinyongo, obe aase bagotindeka abageni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio omogondo oyo nigo okorokwa Omogondo bw’Amanyinga goika reero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio rigaikeranigwa eriatebetwe nomobani Yeremia, ogoteeba, “Bakaimokia chitaabu chiria chi’echifeta emerongo etato, rigori riaye oria obegetwe rigori n’abanto bande b’Abaisraeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bagachiira ase okogora omogondo bw’omokori chinyongo, buna Omonene achigeete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pilato okoboria Yeso amaborio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 15:2-15; Luk 23:3-5,13-25; Yoh 18:33—19:16)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nere Yeso agatenena ase gabana bw’Abarumi; oyio omobooretie, “Naye Omorwoti bw’Abayahudi?” Yeso akamoteebia, “Naboigo, aye gwateebire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero Abakuani abanene na abagaaka bamosoerete, tairaneria ing’ana rinde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Pilato akamoteebia, “Toigweti amang’ana aya amange bakona‐goteeba igoro yao?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ere tairaneria rinde, nonya nase ring’ana erimo, na gabana agakumia mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono ekero kie rituko rinene nigo yarenge engencho ya gabana gosiborera Abayahudi omosibwa oyomo oyo barigetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbabwate omosibwa oyomo omanyekanete, okorokwa Baraba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio kobasangererekanire, Pilato akababoria, “Norori morigetie mbasiborere ase abasibwa aba babere Baraba gose Yeso, oyo okorokwa Kristo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiagera konya omanyire ng’a Abayahudi nigo baruete Yeso ase obogechi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Pilato aikaransire ase ekerogo gi’ekiina, akarenterwa amang’ana na mok’aye, ogoteeba, “Oyio nomonto omonyene oboronge, tobaisa kwebwatia asare, ekiagera reero inachandetwe namange ase okorota ase engencho yaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono abakuani abanene na abagaaka bakagenka emeganda ng’a baborie baegwe Baraba, na Yeso bamoite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Pilato akaboria omoganda oria naende, “Ase abanto aba babere, norori morigetie mbasiborere?” Bakamoteebia, “Baraba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato akababoria, “Imokore naki Yeso, oyo okorokwa Kristo?” Bakamoteebia bonsi, “Tiga abambwe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akababoria, “Nase ki? Mbobe ki akorete?” Barabwo bakamenta goaka egeturi, bakobora, “Tiga abambwe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Pilato achia korora ng’a gento tikenyarekaneti asare, ne rirorooche rioka rikona‐kobucha, akaimokia amaache, agaisaba amaboko aye ase obosio bw’omoganda, ogoteeba, “Inche tindi na komocha ase amanyinga y’omonto oyo omonyene oboronge. Niigoro yaino abanyene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi bakairaneria, “Amanyinga aye, tiga abe igoro ase tore, na ase abana baito!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akabasiborera Baraba, na magega gaakire Yeso emecharichi, akabamotigera anyare kobambwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abasikari bagochecheria Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 15:16-32; Luk 23:26-43; Yoh 19:17-27)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abarwani ba Pilato bakaira Yeso ime ase enyomba y’egabana, bakamosangererekanera omoganda omogima bw’abarwani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamorusia chianga chiaye, bakamobeekera eyanga embariri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagatwang’a egutwa y’amagwa, bakamobeekera motwe, na egetonto bakamobekera ase okoboko kwaye gw’okorio; bagatung’ama asare, bakamochecheria na kobora, “Ochie kare, Omorwoti bw’Abayahudi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bakamotwera amate, bakaimokia egetonto keria, bakamoaka ase omotwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobamochecheirie, bakamorusia eyanga eria embariri, bakamobeekera chianga chiaye omonyene, bakamoira isiko abambwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobagosoka korwa ase omochie, bakarora omonto oyomo, Omokurene, okorokwa Simioni; erio abasikari bakabetereria omonto oyio abogorerie Yeso omosalaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagachia goika aase akorokwa Gologotha (engencho yaye: Aase Ekeore),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakamoa edivai esang’anirie egento ekeroro, anywe; Agachia koyeigwa, tancha konywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobamobambire bagakora obomera, bagaatanana chianga chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bagaikaransa komorigereria aria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igoro ase omotwe oye bakabeeka ogosoerwa kwaye, koriikire, “OYO NERE YESO, OMORWOTI BW’ABAYAHUDI”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abauri babere bakabambwa amo nere, oyomo ensemo y’okoboko kwaye gw’okorio, na oyomo ensemo y’okoboko kwaye gw’okobee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na barabwo abaare goeta, bakamorama, bagosinga‐singisia emetwe yabo, bakobora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye oyogotagora Hekalu na koyeagaacha ase amatuko atato, etoorie! Onye naye Omwana o Nyasae, ika korwa ase omosalaba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na baria abakuani abanene bagakora boigo, bakamokorera echeche amo naborokia b’amariiko na abagaaka, bakobora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Natooretie abande, ere omonyene takonyara gwetooria. Ere n’Omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, tiga aike bono korwa ase omosalaba, na intwe rirorio ntomwegene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo asemeretie Nyasae, tiga Nyasae amotoorie bono, onye omoganetie, ekiagera nateebete: Inche n’Omwana o Nyasae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na baria abauri, abaabambetwe amo nere, bakamorama boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kwa Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 15:33-41; Luk 23:44-49; Yoh 19:28-30)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono korwa chinsa isano nemo omosunte okaba igoro ase ense yonsi goika chinsa kianda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiachia koba ang’e chinsa kianda, Yeso, akarera neriogi rinene, akabora, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Okoonchorwa kwaye, “Nyasae one, Nyasae one, naki gwantigire?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abande b’abwo bateneine aroro, bakayaigwa, bakaboora, “Omonto oyo n’Elija akorangeria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio kegima oyomo obo akaimokia esifunchi, akayeichoria chinkama, akayebeeka ase egetonto, akamoa anywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende baria abande bakaboora, “Tiga torore gose Elija ngocha are komotooria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akarera naende neriogi rinene, erio agatweka mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rora, egetambaa gi’okonacha Hekalu kegatandoka korwa igoro goika inse, gekaba bibere, ense egatengecha, ebitare bigatandoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimbeera chikamaanoka chigaasama, na abanto abange abachenu konya bakuure bakabokigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaruure ase chimbeera, magega y’okoboka kwa Yeso bagasoa ase omochie omochenu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "agwo ase abanto abange babaroche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero omotang’ani bw’abarwani rigana, na abwo barenge amo nere korenda Yeso, bachia korora omotengecho bw’ense na ebiakorekire, bakairoka mono, bakaboora, “Ekeene, oyo nigo arenge Omwana o Nyasae!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbarengeo boigo abakungu abange, barigereretie korwa are, abatunyanete Yeso korwa Galili, bakomokorera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase abwo nigo barenge Mariamu Magadalena, na Mariamu ng’ina Yakobo na Yusufu, na ng’ina ’abana ba Zebedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogotindekwa kwa Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 15:42-47; Luk 23:50-56; Yoh 19:38-42)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riachia koba mogoroba, omonto omonda bw’Arimathaya, okorokwa Yusufu, agacha; ere nomworokigwa o Yeso orenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyio akagenda ase Pilato, akarigia omobere o Yeso. Erio Pilato agachiika ayoegwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu akaimokia omobere, akayoboyia egetambaa ekiya ki’egatani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akayobeka ase oboina bwaye oboyia, obwabachete ase egetare; naende agaturunkania rigena rinene gochia ase egesieri ki’oboina, akagenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbarengeo Mariamu Magadalena na Mariamu onde, baikaransete bosio bw’oboina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.61"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oboina bokorendwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere, erio riare rituko ri’Esabato, abakuani abanene na Abafarisai bagasangererekana ase Pilato,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakaboora, “Omonene, twainyoire ng’a omong’ainereria oria nateebete ekero arenge moyo: Magega ase amatuko atato nimboke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki, chiika oboina borendwe buya goika rituko ria gatato, aborokigwa baye tibaabaisa gocha komoiba, bateebie abanto ng’a obokire korwa ase abakuure; oborimo bw’omoerio inabobue boria bw’eritang’ani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.27.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.27.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 27:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
